{"seq":3,"slug":"legend-and-history","title":"传说与史实","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/legend-and-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-historical-sun-tzu","title":"历史上的孙子","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/legend-and-history/the-historical-sun-tzu","wordCount":1721,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"life-shrouded-in-mystery","title":"笼罩谜团的一生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/life-and-times/legend-and-history/life-shrouded-in-mystery","wordCount":1811,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"传说与史实\">传说与史实</h1><p>本章考辨历史上真实的孙子。由于年代久远、史料有限，孙子的生平，笼罩着重重的谜团。透过有限的史料，人们依然能够勾勒出，历史上孙子的大致面貌。两篇文档，分别呈现历史上的孙子，以及笼罩谜团的一生。</p>\n"}